  "problem": "Matt decides to distribute some candy to his best friends. The following table shows the number of candies each of his friends received. \n\n| Friends | Rose | Peter | Adriana | Vanessa | Helen | Luis | Jason |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Candies | $5$ | $6$ | $10$ | $9$ | $4$ | $3$ | $6$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nWhat is the ratio of friends who received at least $8$ pieces of candy to those who received less than $8$ pieces of candy?\n\nThe required ratio is{{field-1}}\n$:$\n{{field-2}}",
